<view xhs:if="{{a}}" class="vip-popup-mask data-v-fba9f1e2" bindtap="{{i}}"><view class="vip-popup-container data-v-fba9f1e2" catchtap="{{h}}"><view class="close-btn data-v-fba9f1e2" bindtap="{{b}}"><image src="https://minixhs.chugao520.com/makefriends/images/close-white.png" class="close-icon data-v-fba9f1e2"/></view><view class="popup-title data-v-fba9f1e2">会员功能介绍</view><view class="feature-panel data-v-fba9f1e2"><view class="feature-item data-v-fba9f1e2"><image src="https://minixhs.chugao520.com/makefriends/images/vip.png" class="feature-icon data-v-fba9f1e2"/><view class="feature-content data-v-fba9f1e2"><text class="feature-title data-v-fba9f1e2">查看喜欢我的人</text><view class="feature-desc data-v-fba9f1e2"><text class="data-v-fba9f1e2">查看喜欢我的人，</text><text class="highlight data-v-fba9f1e2">直接免费解锁微信</text></view></view></view><view class="feature-item data-v-fba9f1e2"><image src="https://minixhs.chugao520.com/makefriends/images/filter.png" class="feature-icon data-v-fba9f1e2"/><view class="feature-content data-v-fba9f1e2"><text class="feature-title data-v-fba9f1e2">高级筛选功能</text><text class="feature-desc data-v-fba9f1e2">根据收入、学历、购房等条件筛选嘉宾</text></view></view><view class="feature-item data-v-fba9f1e2"><image src="https://minixhs.chugao520.com/makefriends/images/lock-red.png" class="feature-icon data-v-fba9f1e2"/><view class="feature-content data-v-fba9f1e2"><text class="feature-title data-v-fba9f1e2">查看所有嘉宾</text><text class="feature-desc data-v-fba9f1e2">查看全站嘉宾，不包含微信解锁</text></view></view></view><view class="package-list data-v-fba9f1e2"><view xhs:for="{{c}}" xhs:for-item="pkg" xhs:key="e" class="{{('data-v-fba9f1e2') + ' ' + 'package-item' + ' ' + pkg.f}}" bindtap="{{pkg.g}}"><view class="package-title data-v-fba9f1e2">{{pkg.a}}</view><view class="package-price data-v-fba9f1e2"><text class="price-value data-v-fba9f1e2">{{pkg.b}}</text> 元/月 </view><view xhs:if="{{pkg.c}}" class="package-subtitle data-v-fba9f1e2">{{pkg.d}}</view></view></view><button class="pay-btn data-v-fba9f1e2" bindtap="{{d}}">立即开通</button><view class="protocol data-v-fba9f1e2"><image src="{{e}}" class="checkbox-icon data-v-fba9f1e2" bindtap="{{f}}"/><text class="data-v-fba9f1e2">同意《</text><text class="protocol-link data-v-fba9f1e2" bindtap="{{g}}">在线充值服务协议</text><text class="data-v-fba9f1e2">》</text></view></view></view>